# Establishes one authoritative URL for the report tool - a real 301 redirect is a much stronger
# signal to Google than a canonical tag alone, since it actually eliminates the duplicate URL rather
# than just hinting which one to prefer. Standardizing on the clean URL (no .html) since that's
# generally considered better practice, and matches what internal links now point to directly.
/land-report.html   /land-report   301!
